<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 7.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    93/94    100/101     UNQ     187/188</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  100/101   106/107   193/195   205/210</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker suppliers maintained firm bunker</p>
<p>quotes on Wednesday amid firm strong fuel oil swaps, traders</p>
<p>said. Enquiries improved slightly from last week but most</p>
<p>shipowners covered only minimum requirements because of the high</p>
<p>offers.  -- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
